[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="ItemDef" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/world/item_def.gd" id="1_item"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item")
id = &"lore_hollow_index"
display_name = "The Hollow Index"
spine_colour = Color(0.16, 0.3, 0.46, 1)
text = "[i]Placeholder text: replace or approve.[/i]

An index of this hall, written by someone who never finished it. The first pages list the shelves as they stand. The later pages list shelves that are not here: a bay of red bindings \"west of the west wall\", a stair \"down from the iwan, under the tree\".

In the margin, in another hand: [i]I went looking for the stair. The wall was warm.[/i]

The last entry is only a heading. The pages after it have been cut out, cleanly, as if with care."
